Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.23,0:00:05.06,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san, how are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:08.48,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,My sunburn hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:11.82,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Well, it was quite sunny at the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:15.49,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah... Maybe I cut a little {\i1}too{\i0} loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:18.91,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I guess we won't be able \Nto go out for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.91,0:00:20.74,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Just take it easy at home, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:22.33,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:24.50,Italics,Newscaster,0,0,0,,{\an8}Next in the news...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:29.34,Italics,Newscaster,0,0,0,,{\an8}The annual fireworks display \Nwill be held this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:36.71,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\fs20\c&H2C3537&\3c&HEFF2F3&\pos(320.666,281.333)}Fireworks show to be held this weekend
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:35.55,Italics,Newscaster,0,0,0,,{\an8}Many visitors from outside the city are \Nexpected to come for the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.51,0:00:39.76,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:42.39,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:44.10,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:46.19,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,There's somewhere I'd like to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.19,0:00:47.35,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'll go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.35,0:00:48.27,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,That was quick...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.56,0:00:51.36,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But your sunburn still hurts, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:53.49,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,It'll be okay in a day or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.49,0:00:55.18,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You really are resilient.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.45,0:00:57.45,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,So let's go see the fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.07,0:01:00.12,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Sure!
