Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.25,0:02:39.26,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an8\frz18\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\3c&H91EEFB&\4c&H1FB3CC&\c&H082D4B&\move(423.333,197.334,423.333,227.334)}10,000 fireworks visible\N from the main street!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.25,0:02:39.26,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Lucky you, going to see the \Nfireworks with Mii-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.26,0:02:41.01,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Is this a jinbei?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.01,0:02:44.93,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,Hmm... Looks like my old one doesn't fit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.93,0:02:49.02,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Of course it doesn't. \NHe's nowhere near your size.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:50.52,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Go with a yukata.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.52,0:02:51.52,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.06,0:02:54.86,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,I haven't seen fireworks in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:02:59.03,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,They're so gorgeous, \Nbut there's always such a big crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:04.58,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, but apparently Shikimori-san has \Nnever been to a live fireworks show.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.78,0:03:09.46,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Fireworks really are more impressive \Nin person, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.29,0:03:12.75,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,Yuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.75,0:03:13.58,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.25,0:03:18.09,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,There is something I must tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.34,0:03:19.13,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.22,0:03:21.34,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.84,0:03:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs12\frz-5\shad0\bord0\pos(215.334,128)}How to Wear a Yukata: Women
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.84,0:03:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs12\frz-5\shad0\bord0\pos(205.334,220.667)}Wind the ends of the datejime\N sash around your back \Nand tie them in the front
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.26,0:03:26.85,Italics,Woman,0,0,0,,Wind the ends of the \Ndatejime sash around your back
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.85,0:03:28.35,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,and tie them in the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.77,0:03:31.19,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,So this goes like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.52,0:03:34.94,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:38.54,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It's all tangled up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.86,0:03:41.28,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'll never get this done in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.74,0:03:46.66,Main,Brother,0,0,0,,Lift up your arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.66,0:03:47.91,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.75,0:03:54.42,Main,Brother,0,0,0,,There. You're set.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:56.63,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.63,0:03:59.17,Main,Brother,0,0,0,,I swear, you're so clumsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.26,0:04:01.26,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.01,0:04:05.01,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\fnArial\fs14\frz-1\shad0\3c&HFEFDFB&\c&HA28182&\move(308.667,5.334,308.667,32.667)}Suzumi Fireworks Show
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.01,0:04:05.01,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\fnArial\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&HA28182&\move(277.333,66.001,277.333,93.001)}Grand Venue
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.01,0:04:08.01,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnArial\fs14\b1\c&H5D2F46&\3c&HEDB1BE&\bord1\4c&HAB2B41&\move(54,239.666,85.333,239.333)}Takoyaki\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h{\c&H36F2FF&\3c&H10A5B7&\shad0}Chocolate Bananas\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h{\c&H78525E&\3c&HDBB6BF&}Buttered Potatoes\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h{\c&H382557&\3c&HA68ACA&}Yakisoba
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.01,0:04:10.35,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Waterproof smartphone case, check.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.35,0:04:11.64,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Bandages, check.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.93,0:04:16.27,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,And I divided my money into three wallets, \Nso I can lose two and still be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.27,0:04:17.01,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.36,0:04:19.44,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,No matter what happens to me today,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:22.49,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make sure Shikimori-san \Nenjoys the fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.66,0:04:28.12,Main,Kid,0,0,0,,Mom, that guy is laughing to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:28.99,Main,Mom6,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.58,0:04:36.17,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,That said, I hope I'll be able to find her...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.75,0:04:38.59,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.59,0:04:40.88,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, good! Shikimori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.42,0:04:44.38,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I hope I didn't keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:48.64,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sh-She's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.30,0:04:52.18,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,That yukata looks nice on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.18,0:04:55.52,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Y-Yours does, too, Shikimori-san. \NYou look amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.52,0:04:58.23,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.98,0:05:02.48,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Th-That yukata's really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.48,0:05:04.32,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It has kind of a vintage feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.49,0:05:07.53,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It was my grandma's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.99,0:05:10.70,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to wear it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.08,0:05:15.50,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,That's why I've really been looking \Nforward to today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.25,0:05:17.33,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.54,0:05:19.67,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Well, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.67,0:05:20.67,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yes.
