Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.07,0:05:33.91,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(840,840)\fnArial\fs20\fay.15\frz-2\shad0\fry10\b1\pos(77.333,14.667)\c&HF1DCBC&\3c&HF8F7EF&}Magic Show
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.31,0:05:37.85,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(840,840)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\pos(410,108)\c&H383D78&\3c&H4C8FE4&}Fireworks Show Stage
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:47.95,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\pos(309.333,90)\c&H6E1DD0&\shad0\3c&HA87C93&\bord4}C O T T O N   C A N D Y
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.94,0:05:47.95,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\pos(309.333,90)\c&H6E1DD0&\shad0\3c&HEBE3E5&}C O T T O N   C A N D Y
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:47.95,Main,Vendor,0,0,0,,Here you go. One cotton candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.20,0:05:50.95,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wow! It looks tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.45,0:05:54.12,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Are you sure you don't \Nwant one, Shikimori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:56.21,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:05:59.50,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Since I caused so much trouble \Nfor you at the river,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.50,0:06:01.67,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I wanted to do something to thank you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.67,0:06:04.38,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You didn't cause any trouble for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.67,0:06:05.67,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.05,0:06:08.76,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You always do so much for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.13,0:06:11.14,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,and I can never do anything in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.31,0:06:17.06,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Well, the truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:19.90,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I've never cared much for sweet things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.19,0:06:22.56,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.98,0:06:23.82,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.57,0:06:25.82,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Those pancakes...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.03,0:06:30.16,Flashback_Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I could eat these every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.16,0:06:31.12,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.45,0:06:36.25,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But recently, I've started \Nto warm up to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:41.75,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It must be because I always see a certain \Nsomeone enjoying them so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.05,0:06:48.76,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,If you want to thank me, \Nyou've done more than enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:50.97,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.89,0:06:54.93,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I think this might be a little {\i1}too{\i0} sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:06:59.60,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sh-She's just too cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:04.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fay-.2\fnArial\fs14\b1\c&H4477DC&\4c&H9A937B&\3c&HC4EBFF&\move(5.333,122,5.333,202)}Okonomiyaki
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:04.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fay-.05\fry-30\fnArial\fs14\b1\c&H3C527D&\4c&HCDA9C8&\3c&H64E1F0&\move(334,218.666,334,298.666)}Draft Beer
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:04.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fay-.05\fry-40\fnArial\fs12\b1\c&H3C527D&\shad0&\3c&H56ECF7&\move(506.666,179.999,506.666,259.999)}Chocolate \NBananas
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:04.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fay-.05\frz5\fnArial\fs12\b1\c&HEFE7BB&\shad0&\3c&H3C66B9&\move(548.666,266.666,548.666,346.666)}Cotton\N{\c&HB4A1EA&}Candy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:04.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fry-60\frz5\fnArial\fs14\b1\c&HABDEA8&\\3c&HDFFEEA&\move(198.666,156.667,198.666,236.667)}Shaved Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:04.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fry-60\frz5\fnArial\fs14\b1\c&H71E4DD&\4c&HB9F671&\3c&H429D75&\move(305.999,174.667,305.999,254.667)}Crêpes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.31,0:07:02.73,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Why don't we check out the other stalls?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.73,0:07:04.15,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.19,0:07:09.03,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, Shikimori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.32,0:07:10.82,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Let's try the shooting game!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.82,0:07:12.78,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'll get whichever prize you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.78,0:07:16.24,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh? The prize I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.24,0:07:18.00,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Which one do I want...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:20.75,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Hey, that dog's pretty cute, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.75,0:07:23.33,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Is that... a dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:25.29,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs32\c&H1C1922&\3c&HDFECE7&\shad0}WOLF
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.29,0:07:26.80,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.17,0:07:30.59,Main,Vendor2,0,0,0,,Better show your girlfriend \Nwhat you can do, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.93,0:07:34.97,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:47.57,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\fnArial\c&H11100D&\shad0\bord0\move(93.333,28,308,44,1940,3520)}UTTER
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:47.57,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an9\b1\fnArial\c&H11100D&\shad0\bord0\pos(636,43.334)}FAILURE
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.94,0:07:43.85,Main,Vendor2,0,0,0,,T-Too bad, bro...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.85,0:07:47.57,Main,Vendor2,0,0,0,,But here! You can have this kitty \Non the house! Cheer up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.86,0:07:50.07,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll try my hand, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:54.70,Main,Vendor2,0,0,0,,Oh? Think you can do it, little lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.28,0:07:58.70,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Go for it, Shikimori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.96,0:08:04.96,Main,Vendor2,0,0,0,,This game might be a little \Ntoo hard for a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.29,0:08:07.67,Main,Vendor2,0,0,0,,Why don't I give you one free shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.15,0:08:26.11,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.44,0:08:29.94,Italics,Vendor2,0,0,0,,Who is she? This is no ordinary girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.94,0:08:33.11,Italics,Vendor2,0,0,0,,She definitely had the eyes \Nof a hunter just now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.11,0:08:36.45,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,That was amazing, Shikimori-san! \NYou're so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.49,0:08:39.41,Main,Vendor2,0,0,0,,That really touched me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.41,0:08:41.75,Main,Vendor2,0,0,0,,Here, little lady. It's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.75,0:08:43.71,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.08,0:08:47.71,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Here, Izumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.71,0:08:48.34,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.71,0:08:51.01,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,But you won it, Shikimori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.01,0:08:52.21,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.88,0:08:55.26,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I won it for you, Izumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.47,0:08:59.64,Italics,Izumi/Vendor2,0,0,0,,Ohmigosh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.51,0:09:03.31,Main,Vendor2,0,0,0,,Have a good time, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.98,0:09:10.02,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,How much are you gonna eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.02,0:09:12.03,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,You can't have my chocolate banana.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.03,0:09:14.45,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,I don't even want any sweet stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.16,0:09:17.11,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Izumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.20,0:09:19.37,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Inuzuka-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.70,0:09:21.08,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're all here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:23.62,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Yep. You guys came, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.95,0:09:25.21,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Get anything to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.21,0:09:26.54,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I had cotton candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.54,0:09:28.58,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Ugh, sugar rush...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:32.76,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Micchon, your yukata's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.76,0:09:34.92,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Your hair looks nice, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.92,0:09:39.89,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Uh-huh! Braids with a yukata is super cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.89,0:09:42.64,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You both look cute in your yukatas, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.64,0:09:45.10,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Wearing one really lifts your spirits, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:46.39,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.39,0:09:48.65,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Let's take a picture together!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.65,0:09:50.02,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Oh, good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.52,0:09:54.82,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}Check it out! We look super cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:56.74,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,They're sure having a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.74,0:09:58.03,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}Let's take another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.74,0:09:59.37,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Well, since we all met up,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.41,0:10:00.74,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}Let's get a full-body shot this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.37,0:10:01.45,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,let's go try goldfish scooping!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.45,0:10:02.95,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}Come on, Micchon! Scoot this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:02.28,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.28,0:10:03.45,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,It's on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.33,0:10:05.91,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.91,0:10:09.63,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Well, it's no fun if we don't \Nmake it a real contest!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.63,0:10:10.96,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,That goes for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.96,0:10:12.92,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, I guess so...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.92,0:10:14.92,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fay-.3\fry-20\b1\fnArial\pos(302,119.333)\c&HA589EA&\3c&HD9D5FE&\shad0}Goldfish Scooping
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:14.92,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fay-.3\fry-20\b1\fnArial\pos(302,119.333)\c&HA589EA&\3c&H5630AF&\shad0\bord4}Goldfish Scooping
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.88,0:10:16.38,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Okay, here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.38,0:10:17.42,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.42,0:10:19.39,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Hup! C'mere!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.39,0:10:21.39,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,How'd this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.39,0:10:24.18,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Inu has a competitive streak a mile long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.60,0:10:28.14,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.14,0:10:31.02,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Heck yeah! My first catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.02,0:10:32.86,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Okay, my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.11,0:10:37.74,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I knew this would happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.74,0:10:40.70,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Yeah, baby! I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.03,0:10:46.50,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I will avenge Izumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.00,0:10:52.00,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Challenge accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.13,0:10:56.01,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.22,0:11:03.39,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san's having trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.72,0:11:07.98,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,She might not be so hot at stuff \Nthat requires this kinda dexterity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.85,0:11:13.90,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Oh, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.90,0:11:14.73,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.78,0:11:19.61,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Micchon, you're way too competitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.61,0:11:22.95,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,This isn't good. The fireworks \Nare gonna start without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.95,0:11:24.99,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,She's forgotten why she came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.75,0:11:32.04,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Leave this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.04,0:11:32.75,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.79,0:11:35.59,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,The fireworks are about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.25,0:11:38.51,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}All right! It's on now, Inu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.51,0:11:39.76,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,{\an8}Don't drop the "zuka"!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.76,0:11:41.18,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm gonna win this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.76,0:11:41.18,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.18,0:11:42.59,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,{\an8}Well, I'm not losing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.18,0:11:43.30,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Forget about it. Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.26,0:11:48.27,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Aw, man! Mine broke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.52,0:11:58.32,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's a bit of a walk from here. Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:11:59.86,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Your feet don't hurt, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.86,0:12:02.28,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,No, they're just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.28,0:12:04.07,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.07,0:12:05.20,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Well, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:06.83,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I want to take you somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.00,0:12:17.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fay-.2\fnArial\fs14\b1\c&H453399&\4c&H9A937B&\3c&HA4B4BC&\pos(5.333,194.667)}Okonomiyaki
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.00,0:12:17.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fay-.05\fry-30\fnArial\fs14\b1\c&H1A1211&\bord1\shad0\4c&HCDA9C8&\3c&H705653&\pos(335.333,287.999)}Draft Beer
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.00,0:12:17.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fay-.05\fry-40\fnArial\fs12\b1\c&H1D2730&\shad0&\3c&H324D65&\pos(509.333,249.999)}Chocolate \NBananas
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.00,0:12:17.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fay-.05\frz5\fnArial\fs12\b1\c&HC19B6D&\shad0&\3c&H27285D&\pos(546.666,333.333)}Cotton\N{\c&H9180BD&}Candy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.00,0:12:17.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fry-60\frz5\fnArial\fs14\b1\c&HA18F5F&\\3c&H86C79D&\shad0\pos(199.999,219.327)}Shaved Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.00,0:12:17.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fry-60\frz5\fnArial\fs14\b1\c&H94B99A&\shad0\4c&HB9F671&\3c&H3D6353&\pos(306.666,242.667)}Crêpes
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.58,0:12:17.01,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,Attention, attendees.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:20.01,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\fnArial\fs14\frz-1\shad0\3c&H5C5947&\c&H34281E&\move(308.667,5.334,308.667,32.667)}Suzumi Fireworks Show
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:20.01,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an9\fnArial\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H34281E&\move(277.333,66.001,277.333,93.001)}Grand Venue
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.01,0:12:20.01,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,Please ensure that you have \Nall your personal belongings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.38,0:12:23.01,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I managed to fix the strap, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.38,0:12:25.76,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You already have blisters, Shikimori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.26,0:12:28.47,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.93,0:12:30.18,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Those have gotta hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.72,0:12:33.23,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,All that walking must have \Nbeen really painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.60,0:12:37.23,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You probably shouldn't do any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.65,0:12:38.82,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,So, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.23,0:12:41.61,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Where did you want to take me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.20,0:12:45.49,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, nowhere important.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.49,0:12:47.12,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Please tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.91,0:12:54.04,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,W-Well, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:57.25,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Dad told me about a little-known \Nspot to watch the fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.79,0:12:59.17,Flashback,Akisada,0,0,0,,Yuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.17,0:13:00.05,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.05,0:13:03.26,Flashback,Akisada,0,0,0,,There is something I must tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.76,0:13:06.51,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.51,0:13:11.52,Flashback,Akisada,0,0,0,,There's a great viewing spot that \Nnot many people know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.81,0:13:13.64,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.27,0:13:18.15,Flashback,Akisada,0,0,0,,It won't be crowded and it will have\N a lovely view of the fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.15,0:13:21.65,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,What? How do you know about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.65,0:13:24.28,Flashback,Motoko,0,0,0,,The two of us went there a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.49,0:13:28.03,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You know a place like that?! \NI want to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.03,0:13:29.65,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,But your feet...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.65,0:13:31.04,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I can still fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.04,0:13:33.16,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Against what?! The pain?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.16,0:13:35.29,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Don't talk like some kind of warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.00,0:13:39.92,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm not going to let \Nyou walk any further,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.92,0:13:41.55,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,so let's head to the usual spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.55,0:13:51.31,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,All right. I guess we don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.39,0:13:58.56,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,We can always come again next year, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.69,0:14:02.90,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.36,0:14:05.28,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.40,0:14:07.07,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.11,0:14:09.32,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.70,0:14:12.37,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'll carry you on my back. \NYou can't walk, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.58,0:14:16.12,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,No, no, no! I'm too heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.12,0:14:18.58,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'll snap you right in half!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.92,0:14:22.34,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'll be fine. Let me help you out for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.25,0:14:28.09,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Uh... O-Okay, here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.72,0:14:31.85,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Whoops... Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.72,0:14:31.85,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,C-Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.93,0:14:33.72,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.06,0:14:35.14,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.14,0:14:37.64,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,U-Um, I'm not too heavy, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.64,0:14:39.48,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You're not pushing yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.48,0:14:40.98,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.69,0:14:43.48,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Hold on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.28,0:14:54.83,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,How pretty...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:56.87,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,The fireworks have started.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.34,0:15:07.26,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh? Izumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.55,0:15:09.38,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,The fireworks aren't this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.38,0:15:10.68,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Are you lost?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.05,0:15:12.76,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry, Shikimori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.97,0:15:15.51,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I still want to go to that secret spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.72,0:15:18.23,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,W-With me on your back?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.23,0:15:19.02,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.02,0:15:20.52,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'll walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.52,0:15:21.85,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Let me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.85,0:15:24.27,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Whoa, don't flail around. \NYou're hurting my arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.48,0:15:27.53,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:31.53,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You don't have to push yourself so hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.53,0:15:33.87,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I might not look it, \Nbut I'm actually pretty strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.71,0:15:44.84,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,We're climbing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.84,0:15:45.71,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.05,0:15:48.46,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.46,0:15:49.42,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.28,0:16:11.03,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Why would you go through all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.49,0:16:14.28,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:16.33,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I want you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.66,0:16:18.91,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,to really, truly smile from the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.83,0:16:25.88,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, there it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.88,0:16:27.09,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,We're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:31.47,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Keep it up, Izumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.47,0:16:33.84,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Whoa! Don't make me wobble!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.76,0:16:39.89,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.22,0:16:43.85,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,This is incredible, Izumi-san! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.85,0:16:45.23,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.90,0:16:48.73,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Anyway, there's no one here at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.73,0:16:50.23,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It really is a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.40,0:16:54.36,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Oh, Izumi-san, there's a bench.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:57.37,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah. Let's sit there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.79,0:17:02.58,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.58,0:17:05.67,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yep! Totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.31,0:17:28.73,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,This takoyaki is good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.73,0:17:30.27,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,So good. Too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.57,0:17:31.73,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.73,0:17:33.28,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Wanna go buy some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.11,0:17:37.53,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Let's conquer all of the food stalls!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.53,0:17:40.53,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Hey, you're all pumped up, huh, Hachimitsu?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.53,0:17:41.54,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Well, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.79,0:17:43.91,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Hey! Watch the fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.08,0:17:49.88,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san, are your feet okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.88,0:17:52.67,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Oh... Yes, they're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.13,0:17:55.55,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,And, um... I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.80,0:17:56.80,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.80,0:17:58.55,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,For putting you through all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.97,0:18:02.31,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about that. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.68,0:18:04.68,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.68,0:18:08.31,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I guess knowing that and doing it\N are two different things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.69,0:18:13.11,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I just... want you to think I'm cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.11,0:18:16.82,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I don't want you to see me as weird or bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.82,0:18:19.45,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,That line was the cutest of all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.87,0:18:22.74,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,But isn't it a little late for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.74,0:18:25.45,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I've already seen you doing \Nsome pretty silly things,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.45,0:18:27.41,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,and you get evil looks on \Nyour face all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.41,0:18:28.25,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.58,0:18:29.79,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You're kidding...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.54,0:18:32.84,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're always so proper and perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.30,0:18:38.01,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I think you could at least relax a little \Nin front of me without being embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.84,0:18:42.22,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Always wanting to look good \Nis typical you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.85,0:18:51.48,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Actually... I'm just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.90,0:18:52.73,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.11,0:18:55.28,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I couldn't even invite you here last year
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.78,0:18:59.49,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,because I was so afraid you wouldn't \Nlike me anymore if I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.49,0:19:03.49,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,We're still just friends, so inviting her to \Nthe fireworks would be too obvious, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.49,0:19:05.04,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,What if I scare her off?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.71,0:19:11.83,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I had no idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.42,0:19:17.67,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,So you didn't come to see \Nthe fireworks last year?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.13,0:19:18.76,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.43,0:19:21.72,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I just listened to them from home,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.59,0:19:24.93,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,cursing myself for being such a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.35,0:19:29.52,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Ow! What was that for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.31,0:19:31.52,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You know, last year...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.90,0:19:37.03,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I was waiting all along for you to call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.03,0:19:41.78,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Uh... Y-You were? I-I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.82,0:19:45.74,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:48.45,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It's okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:51.29,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,After all...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.67,0:19:55.63,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Just look at how pretty \Nthis year's fireworks are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.05,0:20:04.01,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Thank you for bringing me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.85,0:20:13.44,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.69,0:20:17.94,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,They're... really pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.15,0:20:24.24,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Well, ready to go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.24,0:20:26.08,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Aren't you at your limit already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.83,0:20:28.66,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Nope, I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.08,0:20:31.50,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.50,0:20:33.08,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:36.34,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,D-Dad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:41.72,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,Watch your step, son. That was dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.72,0:20:43.84,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:48.47,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,And use a light, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.47,0:20:51.23,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Motoko-san! What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.52,0:20:54.48,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Huh? We've been here this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.48,0:20:56.44,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.44,0:20:59.23,Flashback,Akisada,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't that Yuu and Mii-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.23,0:21:01.74,Flashback,Motoko,0,0,0,,Don't, dear. You mustn't meddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.11,0:21:04.15,Flashback,Motoko,0,0,0,,Aren't yukatas nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.15,0:21:07.50,Flashback,Motoko,0,0,0,,Maybe I should've worn one this \Nyear, too. It's been so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.50,0:21:10.35,Flashback,Akisada,0,0,0,,Shall we go buy some next year?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.35,0:21:13.00,Flashback,Motoko,0,0,0,,I wonder if they'll have your size.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.53,0:21:16.34,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Y-You were, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.34,0:21:17.85,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.85,0:21:19.74,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,They didn't hear us, did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.24,0:21:26.95,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,I'll drive you both home. \NYou must be exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.95,0:21:29.02,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,It's late, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.36,0:21:31.52,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.52,0:21:34.01,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Do your feet hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.46,0:21:36.59,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thanks for telling me about this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.59,0:21:39.02,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,The fireworks were beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.67,0:21:41.02,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.21,0:21:46.48,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,More importantly, are you \Nsure you can carry us both?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.48,0:21:48.27,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Oh, he'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.27,0:21:51.72,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,When he was younger,\N he could carry four people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.72,0:21:53.04,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.84,0:22:54.81,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(560,440)\fnArial\b1\fs30\frz7\shad0\3c&HDBE6E5&\c&H5126E8&\pos(498,297.999)}S{\fs28\c&H3DCEFE&}E{\fs26\c&H5126E8&}E {\fs26\c&H3DCEFE&}Y{\fs24\c&H5126E8&}O{\fs22\c&H3DCEFE&}U{\c&H5126E8&}~
